# Code Owners for OpenTAMS
#
# Defines the reviewers automatically requested on a pull request.
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Roster: MAINTAINERS.md. Review thresholds: GOVERNANCE.md.
# Order matters — a later rule replaces an earlier one for the same path.
#
# A rule listing several owners requests review from all of them; one approval
# satisfies GitHub. Paths that GOVERNANCE.md requires two approvals for are
# marked below, and that threshold is enforced by branch protection, not by
# this file.

# Default — every pull request goes to the full maintainer group.
*                                       @Akshay-Narayan-Pai @hamza-u @yashbagdi @naveenrathore81

